meta {
  name: Customer_Auth
}

auth {
  mode: inherit
}

docs {
  Customer sign-in with the site token (`X-Auth-Token`). Steps:
  
  1. A new customer: `sign-up` (email, the password is optional) → code in the email → `confirm` with `confirmation_id` and the code.
  2. A registered customer: `sign-in` with email and password (tokens at once) or with phone → SMS code → `confirm`.
  3. `customerToken` (an hour) goes to `X-Customer-Auth-Token` of `Customer_*`; when it expires — `refresh` with `customerRefreshToken` (one-time, 30 days).
  4. `sign-out` with `customerRefreshToken` ends the sign-in.
  5. A guest without an account: `guest` → a guest token for `Customer_Cart` show and items (90 days). Before an order the guest signs in or up with a code (`sign-in` by phone or `sign-up` without a password, then `confirm`) passing `guest_token`: the guest cart moves to the customer.
}
